OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 16 MAR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GFrom Monday to Thursday, Soweto
OL,12,     Gis joined by French-Syrian
OL,13,     Gflautist Naissam Jalal who has
OL,14,     Gfour favourite jazz albums to
OL,15,     Gshare.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GThe Zagreb Quartet plays music by
OL,18,     GSchulhoff, Haydn and Mendelssohn.
OL,19,     GJonathan Swain presents.
